  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Parent issue to group all REST API completion issues for release 3.4",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "These issues should be ones deemed necessary to complete the REST API - but not bugs with the REST API unless they are serious enough to make the particular method unusable.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Need to determine which of these issues should be completed as part of 3.4 - particularly to get to the stage where the existing \"LITE\" APIs can be deprecated.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
